And his name's just man? Oh, you think he's man?

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:09.920
Or I think metal mech is the machine.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.340
I'm saying if the machine is just machine, then is the guy's name just man?

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:14.840
Yeah. I couldn't tell you.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:16.360
Tony man. Oh yeah.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:19.980
Tony man. It's actually Tony Martin.

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.900
But, um, here's, here's the conjecture.

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.360
Let's say it's metal mech.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:28.340
Right. And, uh, so he, he does not get his health replenished between stages.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:35.100
Uh, so you are just constantly taking a beating on this machine, but the back of the box hinted

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.620
at like that the mech has some mind of its own.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.060
Is that like a missing feature here?

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.140
Should that have been something interesting where like when you're out of the mech, it's

