Like you put them into drive and then you can control the, uh, like the sort of turret

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:28.840
on him. Uh, it, it, it gets a little getting used to, uh, but I think that's the only thing.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:35.700
Like the fact that it's a little less intuitive to control is just them saying it has a mind

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:42.060
of its own. It's funny, Sean, cause I was just thinking that Tony doesn't really drive that car.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.000
He wears it.

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:53.140
What? And the metal mech, you know, like as weird as it is to control, it's also a little weird

