00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:03.320
out that this isn't one of those, just go to the right, uh, side scrolling games where

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:06.680
once you get to the end of the level, it's the end of the level or that there's some kind

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:13.080
of boss. No, you're looking for a key, uh, at some that was hidden somewhere in the stage.

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.420
