item, uh, just sort of like arbitrarily thrown behind something like that is strange.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:13.620
Yeah. And I thought that like the key thing would be the, the, the thing that encourages you to

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:14.600
get out of the mech.

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:18.520
Yes. Like that's what would make the key thing make sense for this.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:20.460
Cause otherwise it's like, I'm in this giant mech.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.000
I don't want to be like doing an escape room.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.460
I want to be pushing through and smashing everything.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:30.880
I want the goal in this mech to be like, how can I power my, my way through to the end

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.980
of this level? Not like searching for something.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:38.340
But I, I do appreciate the idea of like, okay, but this, this will give you like reasons

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:42.780
to interact with both forms of gameplay where you're in the max smashing through things

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.380
and you get out and you're weaker, but now you're a little more agile.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:51.360
